OL,3,GNEWSAFour taken to hospital after crash
OL,4,Abetween car and tractor
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour men have been taken to hospital
OL,7,Ffollowing a crash between a car and a
OL,8,Ftractor in Fife.
OL,10,FThe collision, which involved a white
OL,11,FBMW 3 Series and a blue New Holland
OL,12,Ftractor, happened at about 10:20 on
OL,13,FSunday on the A915 south of St Andrews.
OL,15,FThe 20-year-old BMW driver and two
OL,16,Fpassengers, both 20, were taken to
OL,17,FNinewells Hospital in Dundee: one
OL,18,Fpassenger with life-threatening
OL,19,Finjuries, the driver with serious
OL,20,Finjuries and the other passenger as a
OL,21,Fprecaution.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,425,420,260,160,0,100
